<title>UK: BA ground staff ballot result due Monday.</title>
<headline>BA ground staff ballot result due Monday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The results of a second strike ballot of 9,000 British Airways Plc ground staff will be announced at 1400 GMT on Monday, the Transport and General Workers Union (T&amp;G) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Also on Monday, cabin crews who have already voted for industrial action in another dispute with BA will meet to discuss whether they should strike and for how long.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the T&amp;G union told Reuters on Friday the Monday talks would discuss whether to press ahead with strike action. But he said there was no guarantee a decision would be made straight away. That could come later in the week, he said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
